      "built": false,
      "consequence": "A citizen calling STATUS can only ever be told what SUBMISSION wrote at the moment of submission. Acknowledgement, review, action-required and closure are invisible to them however far the item progresses internally. The field specification records the gap without assigning it - AcknowledgedAtUtc and ClosedAtUtc are annotated \"never written by these six flows, populated by internal triage\" - and no artifact names the flow that would.",
